\\"\\\\n\\\")\n+\n+\n+if __name__ == \\\"__main__\\\":\n+    main()\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\n/tmp/paper-tools/bin/python scripts/consult_references.py > literature/retrieval.log 2>&1\n\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
